=== flags-and-payees
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Income:Gift
2024-01-02 * Aunt ; birthday
    Assets:Cash   20 EUR
    Income:Gift  -20 EUR
2024-01-03 ! pending; with a semicolon right after
    Assets:Cash   1 EUR
    Income:Gift  -1 EUR
2024-01-04
    Assets:Cash   2 EUR
    Income:Gift  -2 EUR
2024-01-05 !
    Assets:Cash   3 EUR
    Income:Gift  -3 EUR
2024-01-06 * * payee may hold any text: 2024-01-01 open X @ = ;
    Assets:Cash   4 EUR
    Income:Gift  -4 EUR
--- out
OK
=== last-line-without-newline
--- args
check
--- in -n
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 x
    A  1 EUR
    B  -1 EUR
--- out
OK
