=== bad-amounts
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 plus sign
    A  +5 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 leading point
    A  .5 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 thousands
    A  1,000 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 trailing point
    A  5. EUR
    B
2024-01-06 seven decimals
    A  0.1234567 EUR
    B
2024-01-07 eleven digits
    A  12345678901 EUR
    B
2024-01-08 two minus
    A  --5 EUR
    B
2024-01-09 unit glued
    A  5EUR
    B
2024-01-10 limits are fine
    A  9999999999.999999 EUR
    B  -9999999999.999999 EUR
--- out
